        "state": "PUBLISHED (PAUSED, DELETED)",
        "description": "AML Property Services are delighted to present this well-maintained three-bedroom terraced house, ideally situated in a quiet residential cul-de-sac within close proximity to University College Cork and Cork City Centre. This lovely home offers comfortable living in a peaceful setting while being just minutes away from shops, cafés, and public transport links.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a spacious sitting room to the front featuring a large corner sofa, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. To the rear, there is a bright and fully equipped kitchen and dining area complete with a dishwasher, washer dryer, and fridge freezer, with direct access to the private back garden. Upstairs, the property includes two double bedrooms and one single bedroom, along with a modern bathroom fitted with an electric shower.\n\nA private garden extends from front to rear, providing an inviting outdoor space. On-street parking with resident permits is available close by, though there is no parking directly outside the property.\n\nAML Property Services kindly ask that you include the total number of occupants, your intended move-in date, and a short bio for each occupant in your enquiry.\nOil heating",
